.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Notebooks and their outputs are development material, not part of the service.
tutorials/
UI/
tests/
tmp/
file_formats/
server_runs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Human participant data -- must NOT enter the image.
#
# An image layer travels wherever the image goes: a registry, a teammate's
# laptop, the deploy host's disk. Anyone who can pull it can read every file in
# it, whether or not the API ever serves that file. The study pipeline does not
# read any of these paths, so they are excluded rather than trusted to stay
# unserved. Verified by building the copy set without them and running the full
# pipeline (see server/README.md, "What is not in the image").
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Raw participant responses from the CoAX and CoXAM studies.
assets/human_data/
assets/human_trials_and_cognitive_parameters/

# Per-participant fitted parameters and trial-by-trial records, keyed by
# Prolific participant id. The runner's FITTED_COAX_PARAMS holds the aggregate
# means it derives from these, so the source rows are not needed at runtime.
src/cognitive_models/CoAX/results/
src/cognitive_models/CoAX/data/
src/cognitive_models/CoXAM/datasets/
src/cognitive_models/CoXAM/outputs/

# The reference study's own UI and mockup server, not part of this service.
src/cognitive_models/CoAX/UI/
src/cognitive_models/CoAX/simulation_mockup/
